Line 2: There's no "if" before this "otherwise".
    otherwise:
    ^^^^^^^^^
An "otherwise" continues the "if" that starts in the same column, just above it.

Line 6: This "otherwise" doesn't line up with its "if".
        otherwise:
        ^^^^^^^^^
An "otherwise" has to start in the same column as its "if". The "if" on line 4 starts in column 1.

Line 9: A one-line "if" can't have an "otherwise".
    otherwise:
    ^^^^^^^^^
Write the "if" with a colon and its sentences on indented lines below it; then the "otherwise" can follow.

Line 15: This "if" already has an "otherwise", on line 13.
    otherwise:
    ^^^^^^^^^
The plain "otherwise" has to come last. For more choices, use "otherwise if" before it.

Line 19: I expected a colon after this "otherwise", but found ",".
    otherwise, say "one-line otherwise"
             ^
Put a colon at the end of the line and the sentences that belong to it on the indented lines below.

Line 22: Something is missing after "otherwise if".
    else if:
    ^^^^^^^
Add a condition that's yes or no, like "if x is 5:".
